**2.  Implement Token Refresh Handling (General Approach):**

    *   The `supabase.auth.onAuthStateChange` listener will automatically trigger when the token is refreshed.
    *   The Realtime initialization function will be called again with the new `access_token`, ensuring that the channels are recreated with the updated JWT.

**3.  Implement Clean Lifecycle Management (General Approach):**

